                        <div class="col-sm-6 uppercase bold font-blue-dark">
                            <i class="fa fa-calendar" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <time unixtime="1777080671" title="Saturday, April 25, 2026 1:31:11&#x202F;AM" datetime="2026-04-25T01:31:11.0000000&#x2B;00:00" format="U" dateonly="true">Saturday, April 25, 2026 1:31:11&#x202F;AM</time>
                        </div>
                        <div id="description-163431" class="margin-top-10 col-xs-12" style="display: none; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word">
                            <p><span style="font-weight: 400">Leon awakened a mage class, which should have made his future easy.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Instead, it ruined his first dungeon run.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">He suffers from Mana Overflow, a condition that causes every spell he casts to overload, warp, and become far more destructive than intended. That would already be bad enough, but after one accident left his teammates badly injured, nobody wants him in their party.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Broke, desperate, and one unpaid rent away from losing even his room, Leon does the only thing left.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">He enters a dungeon alone.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">It should have been suicide. A level one mage with no control, no party, and a reputation as a walking disaster has no business solo diving.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">But monsters do not care about reputation. And Leon’s flaw may be far deadlier than anyone realized.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">With each dungeon run, Leon begins to discover that the very condition which made him unwanted may also make him terrifying. If he can survive long enough to master it, he might become something the guild has never seen before:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">A true solo dungeon diver.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">A progression fantasy featuring dungeon delving, levels, magic growth, dangerous spells, and an underdog mage whose broken power may turn him into something unstoppable.</span></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
