                        <div id="description-132765" class="margin-top-10 col-xs-12" style="display: none; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word">
                            <p><span style="font-weight: 400">Elena got fired from her job as a successful saleswoman and then got placed on Truck-kun’s number one most hated list--all at once.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Transmigrated to a world vastly different from her own, she must navigate an age-old beef between her new self and the fickle goddess she once served. And what's with this talking scythe--why does it keep calling her his love???</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">What do you mean, it's her husband?</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">And why is it </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400">her </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400">responsibility to solo an S-class dungeon to bring his human body back?!</span></p>
<hr>
<p>What you can expect:</p>
<p>Fantasy and video game worldbuilding</p>
<p>EVENTUALLY OP main character (MC starts OP, then has to progress again due to circumstances)</p>
<p>Non-conventional dungeon crawling</p>
<p>Slow plot progression</p>
<p>Frequent updates: MWF, occasional weekend</p>
<p>And lastly, a great time!</p>
