                        <div id="description-190530" class="margin-top-10 col-xs-12" style="display: none; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word">
                            <p>A much shorter and more balanced version of Solo Leveling. The progression was too fast for my taste, so I trimmed the power creep and deleted unnecessary elements, e.g. potions and invisible armor. I also cut the POVs of other characters and tweaked a few story elements... OK, you got me, I tweaked some stuff HEAVILY, but that's precisely why I wanted to share my version with you. Buckle up and enjoy, dear reader!</p>
<p>Concerning the chapter lengths:<br>I split the chapters according to the original light novel. To make editing easier, I kept the chapters separated, so some chapters will be 'normal' of over 1400 words while other chapters got shortened to less than 300 words.</p>
<p>The first Double Dungeon is almost the same, but after that you will notice more and more changes, some of them drastic.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
