                        <div id="description-47778" class="margin-top-10 col-xs-12" style="display: none; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word">
                            <p>Pulled into a different world that breathes the word "anime" as a Would-Be Hero, Raze goes against all odds to save this world to get back to his own as quickly as possible. Fighting against the stuff of nightmares. An undead horde constantly knocking onto the living's doorstep! Keeping his hands will be full dealing with... everything! Will he be alright and ready to accept the grueling challenge? Having been told that years in this new world turn into minutes on Earth, he knows his life will be okay once he returns. But, is this world truly able to be saved by a "Solo Battle Mage" who is starting with only the basics in magic? Someone the denizens of this world don't even know? Bound by contract, he must do what he can to save this world or face untold consequences.</p>
                        </div>
