                        <div id="description-163977" class="margin-top-10 col-xs-12" style="display: none; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word">
                            <p>"Death was my only reward... so why are you forcing me to return to this hell?"</p>
<p></p>
<p>In the middle of a colossal library whose shelves were lost in an endless nebula, **[Kang Min-ho]** awoke to find himself before an entity overflowing with coldness and arrogance. There was no hell or heaven as he had expected after his death; there was only **[The Master of Fate]**, who spoke with a provocative solemnity: "You have been chosen to transition to another world, Min-ho."</p>
<p></p>
<p>Min-ho’s response was not one of gratitude, but a furious scream in the face of existence. He had tasted enough hypocrisy and lies for death to be his ultimate wish. Yet, in that library and before this entity, "human will" weighed nothing against the majesty of his power.</p>
<p></p>
<p>**"I refuse."** A word cast by Min-ho, to which the Master of Fate replied with a faint smile and a silence more terrifying than a threat. The decision had already been made:</p>
<p></p>
<p>**Min-ho would be the new "puppet" on the stage of (Solo Leveling) to break the Master of Fate's boredom.**</p>
<p></p>
<p>Since returning to the "hell of life" had become an inevitable fate, Min-ho decided he would not go unarmed. He extorted his own pact in exchange for his soul:</p>
<p></p>
<p>1. A *System* that knows no impossible to raise his power and surpass human limits.</p>
<p>2. The **Sharingan eyes** with all their terrifying abilities and evolutions, to see the truth behind the deception of this world.</p>
                        </div>
