                            <time unixtime="1741919423" title="Friday, March 14, 2025 2:30:23&#x202F;AM" datetime="2025-03-14T02:30:23.0000000&#x2B;00:00" format="U" dateonly="true">Friday, March 14, 2025 2:30:23&#x202F;AM</time>
                        </div>
                        <div id="description-108284" class="margin-top-10 col-xs-12" style="display: none; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word">
                            <p>Synopsis</p>
<p></p>
<p>In a world where dungeons spill forth chaos and Hunters wield supernatural power, Jasmine Borgahain, an elite Indian S-Rank Hunter, is thrust into the unknown when she awakens a mysterious system unlike any other—the Primal Beast System.</p>
<p></p>
<p>Unlike other Hunters who grow stronger through traditional means, Jasmine's power doesn’t rely on weapons, skills, or mana. Instead, she bonds with the ancient mythological beasts that once roamed the Earth—creatures of legend, long sealed away in the depths of India's most dangerous dungeons.</p>
<p></p>
<p>As Jasmine unlocks the essence of forgotten titans, she begins to uncover a hidden war that predates the Monarchs and Rulers—a battle between primordial beasts that once ruled the world. But the deeper she dives into her new powers, the more she realizes that something, or someone, is watching.</p>
<p></p>
<p>Hunters, guilds, and even forces beyond human understanding begin to move. An entity lurking in the shadows whispers:</p>
<p></p>
<p>"The beasts were never just monsters… they were kings of their own era. And you, Jasmine Borgahain, are the last of their kind."</p>
<p></p>
<p>With the fate of India's Hunter world at stake, Jasmine must master the power of the Primal Beasts, challenge SSS-Rank dungeons, and survive a threat greater than any Monarch.</p>
<p></p>
<p>But the real question remains—will she remain human, or will she become something else entirely?</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p>---</p>
<p></p>
<p>Author’s Thoughts</p>
<p></p>
<p>I’ve always been fascinated by the world of Solo Leveling—its fast-paced action, overpowered characters, and the thrill of dungeon battles. But one thing I always wondered was: What about the rest of the world?</p>
<p></p>
<p>Jin-Woo’s journey was legendary, but what if another force was awakening outside Korea? What if the dungeons in India weren’t just random breaks, but remnants of something ancient—something older than even the Monarchs and Rulers?</p>
<p></p>
<p>This fanfiction is my way of expanding the world of Solo Leveling while introducing something new and unique. Instead of shadow soldiers or divine power, this story will focus on beast-based abilities, tapping into India's rich mythology.</p>
<p></p>
<p>No Gods, Only Beasts – This isn’t about divine blessings or celestial powers. The Primal Beasts are creatures of raw strength and instinct, their power tied to the very foundation of the world.</p>
<p></p>
<p>A Hunter’s Journey – Jasmine isn’t a copy of Jin-Woo; she has her own struggles, limits, and ambitions. Her journey will be different, brutal, and unpredictable.</p>
<p></p>
<p>A World Beyond Monarchs – What if the Monarchs weren’t the only ancient rulers? What if something else had been waiting in the dungeons, biding its time?</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p>This story is for those who love action-packed battles, power-ups, and a deep dive into mythology, all within the Solo Leveling universe.</p>
<p></p>
<p>I hope you enjoy the adventure of Jasmine</p>
<p>Borgahain: The Last Primal Hunter.</p>
<p></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
