                        <div id="description-75128" class="margin-top-10 col-xs-12" style="display: none; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word">
                            <p>Al is a No Life with an ability to transfer into another life each time he dies, living with an apathetic compulsion to fall into a tragedy shortly after transfers.</p>
<p><span>" If I wasn't so lazy, maybe I could have been an S Ranker by now."</span><br><br><span>[ If you stop dying maybe you would.]</span></p>
<p>This is a multiversal Solo Leveling fanfiction of a dead-man with an ability to transfer through multiple realities.&nbsp;</p>
<p>[ This series will contain explicit content such as the involvement of sex, violence and themes involving death and the worst sin: Bad spelling and grammar. This novel is R18, but its not focused on being dark.]</p>
<p></p>
