                        <div id="description-131080" class="margin-top-10 col-xs-12" style="display: none; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word">
                            <p>What if "Solo Leveling" wasn't just about getting stronger......but about collecting the memories of a broken multiverse? In this mythic dark fantasy epic, dungeons are "fractures in reality"-echoes of dead timelines. The "System" isn't a game mechanic. It's the "final will of a dying cosmic being", choosing one person to repair the multiverse. That person? Sung Jin-Woo.</p>
