                        <div id="description-149614" class="margin-top-10 col-xs-12" style="display: none; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word">
                            <p>Ethan found himself transmigrated into the world of Solo Leveling. Using the knowledge he brought with him, he acquired the Shadow Monarch’s skill and fought his way through the world.</p>
<p>But even after conquering everything, he still wasn’t satisfied. He searched for the cause of how he arrived in this world and eventually found a way to use the gates to move to another world.</p>
<p>Follow his journey as he finds himself in the Naruto world with the Shadow Monarch’s ability, gathering the best shadows from the multiverse.</p>
<p>“Gotta catch them all!”</p>
